#### 7. Sensitive Equality
**Academic name:** Sensitive Equality (Peruma et al. 2020)
**Affected:** `GetOrderSummary_ReturnsFormattedString` (line 135)

```csharp
// ❌ Assertion couples to ToString() format
Assert.AreEqual("Order ORD-001: 1 item(s), Total: $99.99", summary.ToString());
```

**Fix:** Assert on structured properties instead:

```csharp
Assert.AreEqual("ORD-001", summary.OrderId);
Assert.AreEqual(1, summary.ItemCount);
Assert.AreEqual(99.99m, summary.Total);
```

**Risk if unfixed:** Any cosmetic format change (spacing, currency symbol, locale) breaks the test.

